<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="page-main about-page">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero-inner">
      <span class="about-triad">NATURE. MEMORY. TRADITION.</span>
      <span class="section-kicker">Our Story</span>
      <h1>Where nature, memories & tradition live on</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container about-story-layout">
    <div class="about-story-main">
      <p>Shilptara by Sonali was born from a love for creating with the hands—and a desire to give meaningful things a life beyond their moment.</p>

      <p>Founded by Sonali, a BDS graduate who chose to follow her passion for art and creativity, Shilptara brings together nature, emotions and Indian artistry through thoughtfully handcrafted creations.</p>

      <p>From a flower carrying the memory of a special day to a personalised keepsake made just for you, every piece begins with a story.</p>

      <p>We create real-flower and memory preservation pieces, handmade jewellery, nature-inspired creations, Indian traditional art, customised home décor and personalised keepsakes—each individually designed and personally crafted.</p>

      <p>At Shilptara, we believe in preserving the beauty of nature, the emotions behind our memories, and the traditions that connect us to who we are.</p>

      <p>Because when someone gives us a flower, a keepsake or a meaningful memory, we know they are giving us more than an object.</p>

      <p class="about-emphasis-line">They are trusting us with a piece of their story.</p>

      <p>And that trust is what makes every Shilptara creation personal.</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-story-card">
      <span class="about-triad about-triad-card">NATURE. MEMORY. TRADITION.</span>
      <h2>Three things worth preserving.</h2>
      <p>True craftsmanship is not only about creating something beautiful, but giving something meaningful a life beyond its moment.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/shop">Explore the Collection</a>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="section soft-bg"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading centered"><span class="section-kicker">What we create</span><h2>Explore our categories</h2><p>Jewellery, keepsakes, gifting and flower-preservation pieces, each with its own handmade character.</p></div><div class="category-scroller"><% categories.forEach(c=>{ %><a class="category-circle" href="/shop?category=<%= c.slug %>"><span><img src="/media/category/<%= c.id %>" alt="<%= c.name %>" loading="lazy" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='/seed-images/<%= c.slug %>/01.jpg';"></span><strong><%= c.name %></strong></a><% }) %></div></div></section>

  <% if(reviews.length){ %><section class="section container"><div class="section-heading centered"><span class="section-kicker">Customer stories</span><h2>Reviews from our customers</h2><p>Real feedback and shared photos or videos can appear here after customers submit a review.</p></div><div class="review-grid"><% reviews.forEach(r=>{ %><article><% if(r.media_id){ %><div class="review-media"><% if(String(r.media_type||'').startsWith('video/')){ %><video src="/media/review/<%= r.media_id %>" controls preload="metadata"></video><% } else { %><img src="/media/review/<%= r.media_id %>" alt="Customer review"><% } %></div><% } %><div class="stars"><%= '★'.repeat(r.rating) %></div><p>“<%= r.comment %>”</p><strong><%= r.reviewer_name %></strong><small><%= r.product_name %></small></article><% }) %></div></section><% } %>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
